## Team Match Appearances

One team’s side of one match. Every match has two team rows, so count distinct match_id when counting matches.

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|------|--------------|------|-------------|--------------|
| key_id | Row Key | integer | Source row key; not a person, team or tournament identity. | key_id |
| tournament_id | Tournament ID | string | Stable tournament identifier; join using this value. | tournament_id |
| tournament_name | Tournament Name | string | Recorded tournament name. | tournament_name |
| match_id | Match ID | string | Stable match identifier; join using this value. | match_id |
| match_name | Match Name | string | Recorded match name. | match_name |
| stage_name | Stage Name | string | Recorded competition stage, such as group stage or final. | stage_name |
| group_name | Group Name | string | Recorded group name; not applicable for some knockout matches. | group_name |
| group_stage | Group Stage | integer | 1 when a group stage applies in this row’s scope, otherwise 0. | group_stage |
| knockout_stage | Knockout Stage | integer | 1 when a knockout stage applies in this row’s scope, otherwise 0. | knockout_stage |
| replayed | Replayed | integer | 1 when this match had to be replayed, otherwise 0. | replayed |
| replay | Replay | integer | 1 when this row is a replay match, otherwise 0. | replay |
| match_date | Match Date | string | Local match date as recorded, in YYYY-MM-DD format. | match_date |
| match_time | Match Time | string | Local match time as recorded; no timezone conversion is implied. | match_time |
| stadium_id | Stadium ID | string | Stable stadium identifier; join using this value. | stadium_id |
| stadium_name | Stadium Name | string | Recorded stadium name. | stadium_name |
| city_name | City Name | string | Recorded city name. | city_name |
| country_name | Country Name | string | Recorded country name. | country_name |
| team_id | Team ID | string | Stable team identifier; join using this value. | team_id |
| team_name | Team Name | string | Recorded team name. | team_name |
| team_code | Team Code | string | Recorded team code. | team_code |
| opponent_id | Opponent ID | string | Stable opponent identifier; join using this value. | opponent_id |
| opponent_name | Opponent Name | string | Recorded opponent name. | opponent_name |
| opponent_code | Opponent Code | string | Recorded opponent code. | opponent_code |
| home_team | Home Side | integer | 1 for the designated home side, otherwise 0; not the host-country flag. | home_team |
| away_team | Away Side | integer | 1 for the designated away side, otherwise 0. | away_team |
| goals_for | Goals For | integer | Goals scored for this team, excluding shootout kicks. | goals_for |
| goals_against | Goals Against | integer | Goals conceded by this team, excluding shootout kicks. | goals_against |
| goal_differential | Goal Differential | integer | Goals scored minus goals conceded. | goal_differential |
| extra_time | Extra Time | integer | 1 when extra time was played, otherwise 0. | extra_time |
| penalty_shootout | Penalty Shootout | integer | 1 when the match was decided by a penalty shootout, otherwise 0. | penalty_shootout |
| penalties_for | Penalties For | integer | Successful shootout kicks for this team. | penalties_for |
| penalties_against | Penalties Against | integer | Successful shootout kicks for the opponent. | penalties_against |
| result | Result | string | Recorded match result for the side, or the source’s match result label. | result |
| win | Win | integer | 1 for a win, otherwise 0. | win |
| lose | Loss | integer | 1 for a loss, otherwise 0. | lose |
| draw | Draw | integer | 1 for a draw, otherwise 0. | draw |

